<view class="admin-page admin-secondary-page">
  <view class="admin-header">
    <view class="admin-title">{{ title }}</view>
    <view class="admin-subtitle">
      维护服务分类名称、状态和排序，保存后由 service 服务层写入分类目录。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-status-card">
    <view class="admin-card-title">分类配置</view>
    <view class="admin-card-desc">
      当前页面只编辑分类展示字段，不修改订单状态机、派单规则或资金相关逻辑。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">基础信息</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">分类名称</text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{ name }}"
        data-field="name"
        placeholder="例如：家政保洁"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">图标文字</text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        value="{{ icon }}"
        data-field="icon"
        placeholder="例如：洁"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">分类描述</text>
      <textarea
        class="form-textarea"
        value="{{ description }}"
        data-field="description"
        placeholder="填写分类说明"
        bindinput="onInput"
      ></textarea>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">配置说明</view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">状态</text>
      <picker
        mode="selector"
        range="{{ statusOptions }}"
        value="{{ statusIndex }}"
        bindchange="onStatusChange"
      >
        <view class="picker-value">{{ statusOptions[statusIndex] }}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="form-item">
      <text class="form-label">排序</text>
      <input
        class="form-input"
        type="number"
        value="{{ sort }}"
        data-field="sort"
        placeholder="数字越小越靠前"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-status-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">边界说明</view>
    <view class="admin-card-desc">
      分类启停只影响服务目录展示和后端筛选结果；核心状态仍以后端为准。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{ errorText }}" class="admin-error-card">{{ errorText }}</view>

  <view class="admin-section-card admin-action-card">
    <view class="admin-section-title">管理操作</view>
    <button
      class="admin-action-button admin-full-button"
      loading="{{ submitting }}"
      disabled="{{ submitting }}"
      bindtap="saveCategory"
    >
      保存分类
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
